  "description": {
   "en": "When Shin Woo-Kyung was forced to take on the role of team leader for the troublesome Planning Team 2, one thought stuck in her mind: \nGu Jung-Ha, who she constantly found in her personal life.\n\nWoo-Kyung tried her best to endure and lead her team, but just when she was about to give up, the high-and-mighty nepotism hire began to change. More specifically, the way he looked at Woo-Kyung did."
  },
